<item><title>Hardrock FC clinches Zimbabwe title in debut top-flight season</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/hardrock-fc-clinches-zimbabwe-title-in-debut-top-flight-50c2ba/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/hardrock-fc-clinches-zimbabwe-title-in-debut-top-flight-50c2ba/</guid><category>Zimbabwe</category><description>The Kwekwe side beat FC Platinum 1-0 at Chahwanda Stadium to finish on 73 points, two clear of Scottland FC.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:46:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/zw.jpg" length="34422" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/zw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mudenda tasks sports committee with seeking weekend Warriors matches</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/mudenda-tasks-sports-committee-with-seeking-weekend-8a6251/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/zw/mudenda-tasks-sports-committee-with-seeking-weekend-8a6251/</guid><category>Zimbabwe</category><description>The speaker wants the committee to ask FIFA to move national-team games from weekdays, after Zimbabwe beat Equatorial Guinea 3-0 on Monday.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:49:31 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/zw.jpg" length="34422" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/zw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
